oss margin is higher and the SG&A is higher.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2024-08-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Still, growth in the third quarter in our DTC channel was up in the high single-digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2024-08-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We saw strength in both the DTC and the B2B channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2024-08-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Full price realization remained very strong at 95%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2024-08-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We have full price realization, over 90% globally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2024-08-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"It's important to be there and to be there with the right product at the right size.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2024-12-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We continue to balance growth between B2B and DTC to meet the growing global demand, achieve our profitability goals and maximize our reach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2024-12-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"In the Americas DTC channel, which is almost entirely digital, we delivered revenue growth in the mid-teens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2024-12-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"While maintaining disciplined distribution to ensure scarcity and strong full price realization of over 90% globally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2024 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2024-12-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"ASP for the year was up 8% driven by product mix and targeted price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Boss","x":"So Oliver, maybe could you elaborate on key drivers of the revenue upside in the first quarter, maybe particularly the direct-to-consumer acceleration that you cited to exit the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"And our DTC business also strengthened during the critical holiday shopping period as strong gifting demand for styles such as the Boston clog led to record traffic to our websites.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Our DTC business grew 10%, a strong result when compared to the 30% growth in the year ago quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"But keep in mind that there is a lot of macroeconomic uncertainty, interest rates, currency movement, tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"And all this is before the impact of any new tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We are leaning into the strong consumer demand in both our B2B and DTC channels and continue to carefully execute on our proven engineered distribution strategy to drive ASP growth, ensure healthy stock levels, and maintain strong full-price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"And coming back to your second question or second part of the question, our sell-through was up around 40% full price, 40% up full price with an average price increase of around 10%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2025-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jay Sole","x":"Why aren't you raising the guidance for the full year given the strong beat that you had in first quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"That is why this shift in consumer behavior favors our B2B channel over DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"This will allow us to capture more in personal shopping demand within our own DTC business and allows us to showcase the full breadth of our product assortment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"And we did this in a global environment with pressure from tariffs and currency volatility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"Importantly, we saw no pushback or cancellations following the July 1 price increases implemented in response to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"Our brand heat is stronger than ever no matter if you look at sell-through, full price realization or our strong order book.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"We believe we can manage the impact of the baseline 15% EU tariff through the actions we have already taken, including targeted price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2025-08-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oliver Christian Joachim Reichert","x":"We are adding automation in manufacturing, investing in IT and infrastructure, and we hope to streamline our processes throughout the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mehdi Bouyakhf","x":"We saw double-digit growth across B2B and DTC in an overall flat to negative market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mehdi Bouyakhf","x":"And again, particularly in our DTC, you'll see these categories trending very well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We achieved all this in an environmental faced by fundamental changes in global tariffs and international trade, a war in the Ukraine, and energy crisis and a significant decline in the U.S. dollar.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Most importantly, we accomplished this in the face of significant tariff and currency pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Full price realization, the ultimate indicator for brand health and demand remains over 90%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2025 Q4","e":"birk","d":"2025-12-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"Regarding tariffs, we were able to offset most of the 2025 impact with targeted price increases, including the July U.S. price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/birkenstock-birk-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"For the foreseeable future, we expect B2B growth will continue to outpace B2C growth, but we are working to balance channel growth and strengthen our DTC business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"As expected, our B2B business outperformed DTC during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"As you know, our margins in the U.S. face headwinds from additional tariffs and the weaker dollar.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"As we discussed at the CMD, adjusted gross profit margin excluding 220 basis points of pressure from FX and 130 basis points of pressure from incremental U.S. tariffs was up 60 basis points year over year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"So we continue to grow there and in other territories double digits, and all this with a 90% plus full price realization across all channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"And we have seen no pushback from partners on any price increases or any kind of adjustments we did so far.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q1","e":"birk","d":"2026-02-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"At our Capital Markets Day, we reiterated our guidance for 2026 for constant currency revenue growth of 13% to 15%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/birkenstock-birk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Keep in mind, the third and the fourth quarters are our 2 largest quarters and are very DTC heavy, especially in EMEA, which is most directly exposed to these external changes and challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mehdi Bouyakhf","x":"And the other one is an indirect impact, mostly in Europe in both our DTC channels due to reduced tourism in some of our key cities and a more cautious sentiment among local consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"The U.S. Supreme Court ruling striking down IEEPA tariffs has actually increased our tariff exposure, at least temporarily.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Our adjusted EBITDA margin remained strong at over 32% despite the impact of FX and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mehdi Bouyakhf","x":"As in previous quarters, we continue to be one of the very few chosen brands, as Oliver just mentioned, and we will continue and do continue to take share with a very strong full price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"So our pricing is very targeted, very granular on a season-by-season, style-by-style level, and it's designed in a way to protect our margin in the first instance and to pass through higher input costs and inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q2","e":"birk","d":"2026-05-13","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"We are reiterating our guidance for 2026 for constant currency revenue growth of 13% to 15%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/birkenstock-birk-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Boss","x":"So Oliver, nice recovery in direct-to-consumer growth this quarter, came in above B2B for the first time in 2 years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Boss","x":"Can you speak to drivers of the improvement at direct-to-consumer and what you're seeing in B2B relative to D2C?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"DTC growth accelerated to 16% in constant currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"APAC continued its high-quality and DTC-led growth, especially in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"Adjusted gross profit margin for the third quarter was 59.2%, down 130 basis points year-over-year, mainly driven by 60 basis points of pressure from FX and 70 basis points of pressure from incremental U.S. tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivica Krolo","x":"Adjusted EBITDA margin of 33.7% was down 70 basis points year-over-year due to 130 basis points of pressure from FX and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"In the largest, most important quarter for EMEA, we saw accelerating consumer demand, especially in our DTC business, both online and in-store with strong full price realization of 93%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"We manage our distribution with discipline to maintain scarcity, properly segment the market, manage channel growth and protect full price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIRK 2026 Q3","e":"birk","d":"2026-08-13","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Oliver Reichert","x":"Given this continued momentum for fiscal 2026, we raised our guidance for revenue growth to 15% in constant currency and adjusted EBITDA of at least EUR 710 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/20/birkenstock-birk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[58,1,9742,0,0,0,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,0,0,0,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,0,0,0,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,0,0,0,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,0,0,0,7427,1150],[64,1,6401,0,0,0,5141,888],[65,1,6195,0,0,0,5263,530],[66,1,6244,0,0,0,4824,951]],"cinema":[[58,1,9742,0,0,0,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,0,0,0,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,0,0,0,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,0,0,0,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,0,0,0,7427,1150],[64,1,6401,0,0,0,5141,888],[65,1,6195,0,0,0,5263,530],[66,1,6244,0,0,0,4824,951]],"imax":[[58,1,9742,0,0,0,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,0,0,0,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,0,0,0,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,0,0,0,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,0,0,0,7427,1150],[64,1,6401,0,0,0,5141,888],[65,1,6195,0,0,0,5263,530],[66,1,6244,0,0,0,4824,951]],"streaming":[[58,1,9742,2,1,1,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,0,0,0,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,1,0,1,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,0,0,0,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,0,0,0,7427,1150],[64,1,6401,0,0,0,5141,888],[65,1,6195,0,0,0,5263,530],[66,1,6244,2,0,2,4824,951]],"dtc":[[58,1,9742,24,18,6,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,43,33,10,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,27,20,7,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,38,28,10,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,4,3,1,7427,1150],[64,1,6401,5,5,0,5141,888],[65,1,6195,5,3,1,5263,530],[66,1,6244,7,5,2,4824,951]],"ai_spend":[[58,1,9742,0,0,0,7531,1719],[59,1,9191,0,0,0,6947,1542],[60,1,9864,0,0,0,7051,2310],[62,1,7530,0,0,0,5526,1331],[63,1,9233,0,0